        985
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(3) The Vacancy Control Board is hereby authorized to act in such a manner as to give the various agencies maximum flexibility in filling vacancies, consistent with the responsibility of operating the City government within the amounts appropriated for the fiscal year 1969-1970. However, the head of agencies must cooperate with the Vacancy Control Board to the maximum extent possible in realizing savings required to meet potential budget deficits that may arise during the fiscal year.",
